      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve just released a new patch to address the following issue:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fix: Resolved the issue where players with Windows set to Chinese experienced no subtitles or interface text in the game. All text elements should now display correctly.",
